avaritia.lexicon.asgardandelion.0=__UNTRANSLATED__Rumors abound about some kind of godlike flower that can produce a never-ending torrent of mana. If such a mythical flower were to exist, it would probably require wealth and resources beyond mortal reckoning. &oStill not a SAO reference.&r
